            "review_text": "rfrsparkles\nMelbourne, Australia17 contributions\n0\nExcellent pit stop\nJan 2018 • Couples\nJust around the corner from the war museums, this place is a good spot to rest up and plan your next move. Free wifi. Extensive drinks menu in English - coffee, juice, cocktails etc at standard prices. There are snacks but we didn't have any. Head up to third floor for a cool garden rooftop style vibe. If this place was in Melbourne it would be packed! Don't be too scared crossing the road!\nRead more\nWritten January 4, 2018\nLan Khoa P\nThank you very much for coming and review our coffee shop. Wish see you soon!\nWritten August 8, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
